      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Evolution of BOBA CHiC: From Local Roots to Global Presence 
    &lt;div id=&#34;evolution-of-boba-chic-from-local-roots-to-global-presence&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#evolution-of-boba-chic-from-local-roots-to-global-presence&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Empire Eagle Food was founded in 2002, initially operating as a tea and raw material trading company. Over the years, we transformed into a diversified manufacturer, offering a wide range of beverage ingredients, ready-to-drink products, and innovative food solutions.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
